11ef-8d5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"封陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"封陵","place_note":"山西芮城西南風陵渡","start_index":151,"tongjian_id":"8c819563-db0e-11ef-a2a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"8c819564-db0e-11ef-b2c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河中府","place_name_jianti_auto":"河中府","start_index":160,"tongjian_id":"8c819565-db0e-11ef-8781-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东县","start_index":163,"tongjian_id":"8c819566-db0e-11ef-aafe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"風陵關","place_name_jianti_auto":"风陵关","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"8c819567-db0e-11ef-b69c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋阳","start_index":180,"tongjian_id":"8c819568-db0e-11ef-bf1a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"「晉陽」，按史記·世家作「陽晉」，其地當在蒲阪之東，風陵之西，大河之陽；且本晉地也，故謂之陽晉。蘇秦所謂「衞陽晉之道」，蓋以魏境有陽晉，故在衞境者稱「衞陽晉」以別之。括地志曰：晉陽故城，今名晉城，在蒲州虞鄕縣西。水經註：函谷關直北隔河有崇阜，巍然獨秀，世謂之風陵。酈道元所謂函谷，則潼關也。史記正義曰：封陵在蒲州。唐志：河中府河東縣南有風陵關。今若據括地志，則晉陽亦通。","note_content_jianti_auto":"「晋阳」，按史记·世家作「阳晋」，其地当在蒲阪之东，风陵之西，大河之阳；且本晋地也，故谓之阳晋。苏秦所谓「衞阳晋之道」，盖以魏境有阳晋，故在衞境者称「衞阳晋」以别之。括地志曰：晋阳故城，今名晋城，在蒲州虞鄕县西。水经注：函谷关直北隔河有崇阜，巍然独秀，世谓之风陵。郦道元所谓函谷，则潼关也。史记正义曰：封陵在蒲州。唐志：河中府河东县南有风陵关。今若据括地志，则晋阳亦通。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c81954c-db0e-11ef-ac03-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","place_note":"都咸阳，陕西咸阳","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c819570-db0e-11ef-beb0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c819571-db0e-11ef-baa7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武遂","place_name_jianti_auto":"武遂","place_note":"山西垣曲东南","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c819572-db0e-11ef-b38d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],